  {
    "function_v0": {
      "doc": "Shielded\\xe2\\x86\\x92public withdrawal with PRIVATE CHANGE (join-split, 1-in / 1-public-out / 1-change).\\n\\nVerifies the withdraw proof (inclusion of the spent note, its nullifier, a well-formed\\nchange commitment, value conservation `value == amount + change`, a 64-bit range on every\\namount, and the C1 recipient binding), spends the nullifier, and pays the PUBLIC `amount`\\nout to `to`. When `has_change` is true it inserts the change commitment as a new private\\nnote; when false (a FULL EXIT, where the circuit forces change == 0) it inserts nothing and\\nneeds no free leaf \\xe2\\x80\\x94 so a note can always be withdrawn even when the tree is full. Only\\n`amount` is public; the change value is hidden.\\n\\nPublic inputs (pinned order): [root, nullifier, recipient, amount, change_commitment, has_change].\\nEmits WithdrawalCompleted; returns the change note's leaf index (0 on a full exit).",
      "name": "withdraw",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "proof",
          "type_": {
            "udt": {
              "name": "Proof"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "root",
          "type_": {
            "bytes_n": {
              "n": 32
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "nullifier",
          "type_": {
