  {
    "function_v0": {
      "doc": "Confidential shielded\\xe2\\x86\\x92shielded transfer (join-split, 1-in / 2-out).\\n\\nVerifies the transfer proof (which proves, in zero knowledge, inclusion of the spent\\ninput note, its nullifier, two well-formed output commitments, value conservation,\\nand a 64-bit range on every amount), spends the input nullifier, and inserts BOTH\\noutput commitments (recipient + change). **No amount is revealed and NO token\\nmoves** \\xe2\\x80\\x94 value stays in the pool, re-split. Public inputs (pinned order):\\n[root, nullifier, out_commitment1, out_commitment2].\\n\\nONE on-chain insert: only the sender's change (out2) is inserted; the recipient's note\\n(out1) is recorded PENDING for the recipient to insert themselves via `claim_insert`.\\nHalving the per-tx Merkle work is what lets the tree be far deeper. Returns out2's leaf.",
      "name": "transfer",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "proof",
          "type_": {
            "udt": {
              "name": "Proof"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "root",
          "type_": {
            "bytes_n": {
              "n": 32
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "nullifier",
          "type_": {
            "bytes_n": {
              "n": 32
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "out_commitment1",
          "type_": {
            "bytes_n": {
              "n": 32
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "out_commitment2",
          "type_": {
            "bytes_n": {
              "n": 32
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "doc": "",
          "name": "change_ct",
          "type_": "bytes"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "result": {
            "ok_type": "u32",
            "error_type": "error"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "function_v0": {
      "doc": "Claim a received private-send note: verify the recipient holds a valid opening of\\n`commitment` (the `claim` circuit \\xe2\\x80\\x94 value stays hidden), confirm it is a PENDING transfer\\noutput (backing \\xe2\\x86\\x92 no inflation), insert it into the tree, clear the pending flag, and emit\\nits encrypted opening for cross-device recovery. This is the deferred second insert that\\nmakes `transfer` a single-insert operation. No token moves \\xe2\\x80\\x94 the value is already pooled.\\nReturns the leaf index.",
      "name": "claim_insert",
      "inputs": [
